{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32118","headline":"郭处士击瓯歌 · 温庭筠","name":"郭处士击瓯歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"佶栗金虬石潭古，勺陂潋灩幽修语。\n湘君宝马上神云，碎佩丛铃满烟雨。\n吾闻三十六宫花离离，软风吹春星斗稀。\n玉晨冷磬破昏梦，天露未乾香着衣。\n兰钗委坠垂云发，小响丁当逐回雪。\n晴碧烟滋重叠山，罗屏半掩桃花月。\n太平天子驻云车，龙鑪勃郁双蟠拏。\n宫中近臣抱扇立，侍女低鬟落翠花。\n乱珠触续正跳荡，倾头不觉金乌斜。\n我亦爲君长叹息，缄情远寄愁无色。\n莫沾香梦绿杨丝，千里春风正无力。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32118.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32118","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}